            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Faster note capture

- New Note now places the cursor in the writing area immediately, so you can start typing without an extra click.
- The empty New Note launcher also focuses its composer automatically.
- Focus handoff is now resilient to SwiftUI view-mount timing, covering menu, keyboard shortcut, and sidebar creation paths.
]]></description>
